{
    "title": "Ohana Screen Time Control App",
    "description": "\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f The simplest parental control app for parents.\r\n\r\nWe all secretly know it. Studies show that too much screen time can have many negative effects on children.\r\n\r\nParents take action with the Ohana parental control app:\r\n\u231b Screen time control & with daily limits\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 App lock for inappropriate apps\r\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Internet filter for your children\r\n\ud83d\ude34 Automatic schedules to block apps\r\n\ud83d\udcc5 Weekly reports: Screen time & app usage\r\n\u2139\ufe0f Recommendations by experts on screen time control & apps\r\n\ud83d\udccd Location tracking\r\n\ud83e\udd1d Works on all platforms\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude34 <b>Automatic schedules to block apps</b>\r\nThe schedules help to block apps during school time, for homework, or at bedtime. This way, you can establish a routine for screen time control.\r\n\r\n\u231b\ufe0f <b>Screen time recommendations</b>\r\nBased on our age-appropriate screen time recommendations, you can choose a daily screen time limit. Thus, once the screen time limit is reached, Ohana block apps automatically.\r\n\r\n\u2705 <b>Parental control for all devices</b>\r\nOur parental control app supports all mobile platforms. Parental control everywhere.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc5 <b>Weekly reports: Screen time & apps</b>\r\nThe Ohana parental control app sends you an overview. Was the screen time limit reached frequently? Which apps are used most often? Should you set an app lock?\r\n\r\n\u26a0\ufe0f <b>Your child's location</b>\r\nWe not only help you with apps & screen time control but also in real life. Receive notifications when your children, for example, arrive at school. Or share your children's location for a period within the family for more safety. Location tracking always happens transparently for your children with a message in our parental control app.\r\n\r\n\u2757\ufe0f <b>Internet parental control</b>\r\nAutomatically, Ohana provides parental control for inappropriate content on the Internet. 5+ million websites are automatically blocked. Parents get a notification in the Ohana parental control app & can talk to their children about topics in the digital world.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udd93 <b>Try parental control for free</b>\r\nTry the parental control app for parents free for 7 days. After that, you'll know how Ohana helps you with screen time control & parental control.\r\nThe Ohana parental control app helps parents with: screen time control, block apps, internet filter & practical tips for everyday life in a parental control app.\r\n\r\n<b>Effects of too much screen time:</b>\r\n\u2666 <b>Cognitive development</b>: Too much screen time can affect brain development, so ensure you use screen time control app.\r\n\u2666 <b>Emotional development</b>: There is a connection between increased screen time & attention deficit disorders (e.g. AHDS) or depression\r\n\u2666 <b>Sleep problems</b>: Incorrect screen time habits can lead to sleep problems in children\r\n\u2666 <b>Academic performance</b>: More screen time control can be associated with higher grades\r\n\u2666 <b>Development of social skills</b>: Children with too much screen time have been found to have delays in the development of personal & social skills\r\n\r\n<i>\"Easy to use parental control app designed for parents.</i> \u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\"\r\n\r\n<b>About permissions</b>\r\n- The parental control app requires internet\r\n- The parental control app uses the \"Device Administrator\" permission to prevent your kids from uninstalling the app without parent consent\r\n- The parental control app uses the \"Accessibility\" (AccessibilityService API) permission to block & limit apps if the parents restrictions should apply. Info provided by the Accessibility API remains on the kid's device\r\n- To be able to locate the device of your kids, the parental control app requires the \"Location\" permission on Android devices\r\n- The parental control app uses Android's VpnService to block age-inappropriate web content\r\n\r\nFor questions about parental control, block apps, screen time, more: support@tryohana.com\r\n\r\nhttps://tryohana.com/terms\r\nhttps://tryohana.com/privacy-policy",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f The simplest parental control app for parents.<br><br>We all secretly know it. Studies show that too much screen time can have many negative effects on children.<br><br>Parents take action with the Ohana parental control app:<br>\u231b Screen time control &amp; with daily limits<br>\ud83d\udcf1 App lock for inappropriate apps<br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Internet filter for your children<br>\ud83d\ude34 Automatic schedules to block apps<br>\ud83d\udcc5 Weekly reports: Screen time &amp; app usage<br>\u2139\ufe0f Recommendations by experts on screen time control &amp; apps<br>\ud83d\udccd Location tracking<br>\ud83e\udd1d Works on all platforms<br><br>\ud83d\ude34 <b>Automatic schedules to block apps</b><br>The schedules help to block apps during school time, for homework, or at bedtime. This way, you can establish a routine for screen time control.<br><br>\u231b\ufe0f <b>Screen time recommendations</b><br>Based on our age-appropriate screen time recommendations, you can choose a daily screen time limit. Thus, once the screen time limit is reached, Ohana block apps automatically.<br><br>\u2705 <b>Parental control for all devices</b><br>Our parental control app supports all mobile platforms. Parental control everywhere.<br><br>\ud83d\udcc5 <b>Weekly reports: Screen time &amp; apps</b><br>The Ohana parental control app sends you an overview. Was the screen time limit reached frequently? Which apps are used most often? Should you set an app lock?<br><br>\u26a0\ufe0f <b>Your child&#39;s location</b><br>We not only help you with apps &amp; screen time control but also in real life. Receive notifications when your children, for example, arrive at school. Or share your children&#39;s location for a period within the family for more safety. Location tracking always happens transparently for your children with a message in our parental control app.<br><br>\u2757\ufe0f <b>Internet parental control</b><br>Automatically, Ohana provides parental control for inappropriate content on the Internet. 5+ million websites are automatically blocked. Parents get a notification in the Ohana parental control app &amp; can talk to their children about topics in the digital world.<br><br>\ud83c\udd93 <b>Try parental control for free</b><br>Try the parental control app for parents free for 7 days. After that, you&#39;ll know how Ohana helps you with screen time control &amp; parental control.<br>The Ohana parental control app helps parents with: screen time control, block apps, internet filter &amp; practical tips for everyday life in a parental control app.<br><br><b>Effects of too much screen time:</b><br>\u2666 <b>Cognitive development</b>: Too much screen time can affect brain development, so ensure you use screen time control app.<br>\u2666 <b>Emotional development</b>: There is a connection between increased screen time &amp; attention deficit disorders (e.g. AHDS) or depression<br>\u2666 <b>Sleep problems</b>: Incorrect screen time habits can lead to sleep problems in children<br>\u2666 <b>Academic performance</b>: More screen time control can be associated with higher grades<br>\u2666 <b>Development of social skills</b>: Children with too much screen time have been found to have delays in the development of personal &amp; social skills<br><br><i>&quot;Easy to use parental control app designed for parents.</i> \u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f&quot;<br><br><b>About permissions</b><br>- The parental control app requires internet<br>- The parental control app uses the &quot;Device Administrator&quot; permission to prevent your kids from uninstalling the app without parent consent<br>- The parental control app uses the &quot;Accessibility&quot; (AccessibilityService API) permission to block &amp; limit apps if the parents restrictions should apply. Info provided by the Accessibility API remains on the kid&#39;s device<br>- To be able to locate the device of your kids, the parental control app requires the &quot;Location&quot; permission on Android devices<br>- The parental control app uses Android&#39;s VpnService to block age-inappropriate web content<br><br>For questions about parental control, block apps, screen time, more: support@tryohana.com<br><br>https://tryohana.com/terms<br>https://tryohana.com/privacy-policy",
